{"type":"message","message":{"role":"tool","parts":[{"type":"tool-result","callId":"call-3","output":"bash done\n\n## memory for bun run contract:fixtures\n\n### [[Contract Fixtures]]\n\nAfter changing the server's wire, run `bun run contract:fixtures` to regenerate openapi-document.fixture.json and event-shapes.fixture.json, then bump contractVersion by one minor.\n\n### [[Package Manager]]\n\nThe repo uses bun, never npm or pnpm. Install with `bun install`; the lockfile is bun.lock and CI installs with --frozen-lockfile.\n\n### [[Test Gate]]\n\nThe gate is `bun run check && bun run test`. `bun run test` is vitest; bare `bun test` is Bun's own runner and is not the gate.\n\nA task is done only when both are green.\n\nretrieval: lexical","isError":false}]},"id":"2e3547e4-f18e-4431-9703-22c0908cade7","parentId":"58ffa95a-cdd3-4c35-acf9-5766eeead993","timestamp":"2026-10-16T05:59:53.886Z"}
